[Name] LibAdwaita
[Summary] GNOME 4 widget library on top of GTK4
[Description] libadwaita is the GNOME 4 widget library used by GNOME Shell, GNOME apps, Pantheon apps, and (increasingly) elementary apps. Bumped to 1.8 for the GNOME 48 stack. Build AFTER GTK 4.18 and BEFORE Mutter + Granite 7 + Pantheon apps. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
